schway-screen 1
screen grok-plan-error
title Grok plan restriction
description A plan restriction retains the saved login and offers another connection.
variant light-80
size 80x30
cursor 7 27 visible
== text
 ⚡ schway  /project

  ▌ ! Error
  ▌ Your Grok plan doesn't include API access. Use an xAI API key instead ·
